```jsx
import TooltipProvider from './TooltipContext';
import Tooltip from './Tooltip';

// ...

<TooltipProvider>
  <div>
    <button data-tip="Hello, Tooltip!" data-for="my-tooltip">
      Hover me
    </button>
    <Tooltip id="my-tooltip">Hello, Tooltip!</Tooltip>
  </div>
</TooltipProvider>
```

Now, when you hover over the "Hover me" button, the Tooltip will appear, and if another Tooltip is already open, it will be closed automatically.

